Release Notes for Midi66 v. 0.2.0 2026-11-17

- Refactoring from portions of the the Seq66 application and the
  Rtl66 library.
- Additional support for a text-based format similar to midicvt.
- The initial release of the "mftranscript" application for
  conversion between MIDI and text.

See NEWS for more details, and ChangeLog.

